    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: '<b>HOW TO PLAY</b>


    <b>Desktop</b>

    W A S D or arrows: move    Mouse: look

    Left click: grab, press, read

    Holding an object: point where it goes and click.  R + mouse = turn it


    <b>VR</b>

    Left stick: move or teleport    Right stick: turn

    Grip: grab    Trigger: press and read'
